            "review_title": "Review at Pho Ly Quoc Su - Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Dr. Issa Abu-Dayyeh\nAmman, Jordan4697 contributions\n0\nDecent breakfast\nJan 2020 • Family\nVisited the Nha Trang airport branch. They offer eggs and soups mainly. I tried the soup with two eggs in it, and my companion tried the plain egg plate with Baguette.\n\nFood ok, nothing extra special, but place does seem to be clean and service is quick. Prices are good too, around 40-60 k per dish on average.\nRead more\nWritten January 4, 2020",
